      "description": "The Blessing of the Fleet, at Tarpon Springs, which is part of this week's 108th Epiphany celebration, is said to keep sponge boats, fishermen and their crews safe while they are at sea. The blessing is also to help the sea merchants have prosperous journeys.\n\nHis Grace Bishop Sevastianos of Zela, dips some olive branches in holy water.",
